---
import Full from "../layouts/Full.astro";
const appUrl = "https://app.spritesmith.ai";
const clientUrl = "https://github.com/aviorstudio/spritesmith";
const installCommand = "curl -fsSL https://spritesmith.ai/install | sh";
---

<Full>
  <div class="folio">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="spritesmith home"
        ><img
          src="/favicon.svg"
          width="32"
          height="32"
          alt=""
        />spritesmith<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a
      >
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <a href="#formats">The formats</a><a href="#process">How it works</a><a
          class="nav-cta"
          href={appUrl}>Open app <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="art-cover" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="art-copy">
          <p class="tag">
            <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>A SMALL IDEA IS A
            GOOD START
          </p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">
            Little sprites.<br /><em>Big possibilities.</em>
          </h1>
          <p>
            Turn a prompt into a character, a prop, or your next little world.
            Create animated vector sprites, refine them through chat, and take them
            with you.
          </p>
          <a class="cta" href={appUrl}
            >Create with spritesmith <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
          >
          <div class="art-note">
            <span class="note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>
              Start with words. Bring a reference.<br />Leave with a transparent
              PNG or editable SVG.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="art-desk">
          <div class="sprite-card raster-card">
            <div class="card-label">
              <span>01 / ANIMATION</span><span class="file-chip">.PNG</span>
            </div>
            <div class="checker raster-stage">
              <img
                src="/art/lantern-sprite.png"
                width="640"
                height="640"
                alt="Illustrated amber lantern creature with glowing glass and little feet"
                fetchpriority="high"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-foot">
              <span>A little light for your world.</span><span
                aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sprite-card vector-card">
            <div class="card-label">
              <span>02 / SOURCE</span><span class="file-chip">.SVG</span>
            </div>
            <div class="checker vector-stage">
              <img
                src="/art/leaf-sprite.svg"
                width="320"
                height="320"
                alt="Illustrated emerald leaf creature built from clean vector shapes"
              /><svg
                class="path-overlay"
                viewBox="0 0 320 320"
                aria-hidden="true"
                ><path
                  d="M160 54C116 67 76 104 79 153C83 207 132 235 160 250C188 235 237 207 241 153C244 104 204 67 160 54Z"
                ></path><g
                  ><rect x="156" y="50" width="8" height="8"></rect><rect
                    x="75"
                    y="149"
                    width="8"
                    height="8"></rect><rect x="237" y="149" width="8" height="8"
                  ></rect><rect x="156" y="246" width="8" height="8"></rect></g
                ></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="card-foot">
              <span>Shapes you can make your own.</span><span aria-hidden="true"
                >↗</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            Illustrative artwork · not captured product results
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>
      <div class="format-strip" aria-label="Available outputs">
        <span>FROM YOUR IMAGINATION, INTO YOUR PROJECT</span><div>
          <span>Transparent PNG</span><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span
            >Editable SVG</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="formats" id="formats" aria-labelledby="formats-title">
        <div class="section-intro">
          <p class="tag">ONE SPRITE. EVERY ANIMATION.</p><h2 id="formats-title">
            Your sprite.<br />Ready to move.
          </h2><p>
            Describe a sprite and its animations. The agent draws, renders, inspects,
            and refines the result before returning a revision.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="format-grid">
          <article class="format-detail">
            <div class="format-top">
              <span class="tag">01 / ANIMATION</span><span class="file-chip"
                >PNG</span>
            </div><h3>For idle.<br />For action.</h3><p>
              Create a sprite with several animations and a shared appearance.
              Preview its movement, ask for changes in chat, and export
              transparent animation sheets and timing manifests.
            </p><div class="material-sample raster-sample" aria-hidden="true">
              <img
                src="/art/lantern-sprite.png"
                width="640"
                height="640"
                loading="lazy"
                alt=""
              /><span>Every animation, one shared design.</span>
            </div><p class="output-line">
              <span>YOUR DOWNLOAD</span>Transparent PNG
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="format-detail">
            <div class="format-top">
              <span class="tag">02 / SOURCE</span><span class="file-chip"
                >SVG + PNG</span>
            </div><h3>For iteration.<br />For the next idea.</h3><p>
              Keep each chat session private while exploring new ideas. Publish
              a sprite or the whole session to your library when ready.
              Download SVG frames, transparent PNG sheets, and sprite source.
            </p><div class="material-sample vector-sample" aria-hidden="true">
              <img
                src="/art/leaf-sprite.svg"
                width="320"
                height="320"
                loading="lazy"
                alt=""
              /><span>Paths, ready for your next idea.</span>
            </div><p class="output-line">
              <span>YOUR DOWNLOADS</span>Editable SVG + transparent PNG
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section
        class="conversation"
        id="process"
        aria-labelledby="process-title"
      >
        <div class="conversation-copy">
          <p class="tag">AN IDEA. A CONVERSATION. A SPRITE.</p><h2
            id="process-title"
          >
            You don’t need<br />the perfect prompt.
          </h2><p>
            Describe the sprite and movements you have in mind, and see
            where it takes you. Add a reference image when you have a starting
            point. Ask for a change when you want to try another direction.
          </p><a class="text-link" href={appUrl}
            >Start your first conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="chat" aria-label="Illustrative example conversation">
          <p class="chat-caption tag">AN EXAMPLE CONVERSATION</p><div
            class="chat-line"
          >
            <span>YOU / START</span><p>
              A friendly little lantern creature for a woodland game.
            </p>
          </div><div class="chat-line response">
            <span>spritesmith / CREATE</span><div class="chat-result">
              <img
                src="/art/lantern-sprite.png"
                width="640"
                height="640"
                alt="Illustrative lantern sprite response"
                loading="lazy"
              /><p>Your idea,<br />taking shape.</p>
            </div>
          </div><div class="chat-line">
            <span>YOU / REFINE</span><p>
              Give it a warmer glow and tiny green boots.
            </p>
          </div><div class="chat-end">
            <span>REFINE IT. KEEP IT. TAKE IT WITH YOU.</span><a href={appUrl}
              >Open app ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="possibilities" aria-labelledby="library-title">
        <div class="section-intro">
          <p class="tag">THERE’S A PLACE FOR YOUR IDEAS</p><h2
            id="library-title"
          >
            Keep the ones you love.<br />Find your next spark.
          </h2>
        </div><div class="card-grid">
          <article>
            <span class="possibility-icon" aria-hidden="true">↺</span><h3>
              Come back to it.
            </h3><p>
              Keep your sprites and sessions in your library. Pick up an idea
              when inspiration returns.
            </p>
          </article><article>
            <span class="possibility-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h3>
              See what’s out there.
            </h3><p>
              Explore the public gallery and creator profiles. Find something
              that starts a conversation of your own.
            </p>
          </article><article>
            <span class="possibility-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>
              Give it a new home.
            </h3><p>
              Download your artwork and bring it into your project. Transparent
              backgrounds leave the setting up to you.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div><a class="cta" href={appUrl}
          >Make your next sprite <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
      <section class="cli-section" aria-labelledby="cli-title">
        <div>
          <p class="tag">FOR THE WAY YOU WORK</p><h2 id="cli-title">
            An idea from your terminal, too.
          </h2><p>
            The public spritesmith CLI connects to the same generation API. Use
            your account’s API key to create animated vector sprites and
            download the finished file.
          </p><pre class="cli-install"><code>{installCommand}</code></pre>
          <p class="install-requirements">Requires Go.</p><a class="text-link" href={clientUrl}
            >Get the CLI &amp; setup instructions <span aria-hidden="true"
              >↗</span
            ></a>
        </div><div class="terminal">
          <div class="terminal-heading">
            <span aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><span>spritesmith / CLI</span>
          </div><pre><code><span class="code-comment"># After configuring your API URL and token</span>
spritesmith prompt --kind vector \
  --format svg --out woodland.svg \
  'A friendly woodland sprite'</code></pre><div
            class="terminal-foot"
          >
            YOUR PROMPT → YOUR FILE
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="bottom">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/"
        >spritesmith<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a
      ><span>Small ideas, made into something.</span><nav aria-label="Footer">
        <a href={clientUrl}>CLI &amp; API</a><a href={appUrl}>Open app ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Full>

<style>
	.cli-install {
		max-width: 100%;
		margin: 18px 0;
		padding: 14px;
		border: 1px solid currentColor;
		white-space: pre-wrap;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
		font-size: 12px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.install-requirements { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
